WEBVTT

NOTE Visual descriptions only. Audio speech has not been verified.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Rows of rice plants grow in stacked indoor trays beneath horizontal lights.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.500
A person's hand slides one planted tray outward from the frame.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.792
Exposed roots hang beneath a tray. A nozzle releases mist between the roots, where droplets collect.

00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:10.010
Close view of a small sensor fixed to an upright support beside the plants. An amber indicator glows on its face.
